## To total (xs: Seq of Int) -> Int:
    Let mutable sum be 0.
    Repeat for x in xs:
        Set sum to sum + x.
    Return sum.

## To double (xs: Seq of Int) -> Seq of Int:
    Repeat for i from 1 to length of xs:
        Set item i of xs to (item i of xs) * 2.
    Return xs.

## To keep (xs: Seq of Int):
    Show length of xs.

## Main
Let mutable items be [1, 2, 3].
Show total(items).
Set items to double(items).
Show items.
Give items to keep.
